        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "什么时候能喝咖啡",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-14-when-can-i-drink-coffee_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你的水能喝吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-14-when-can-i-drink-coffee_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "不能喝杯子里面的水，杯子里面有咖啡！你喝保温杯里面的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-14-when-can-i-drink-coffee_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "保温杯的水太烫了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-14-when-can-i-drink-coffee_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你知道你什么时候才能喝咖啡和茶吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-14-when-can-i-drink-coffee_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "12岁以上。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-14-when-can-i-drink-coffee_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "12岁就是要上初中以后才行。上了初中才能喝一点。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-14-when-can-i-drink-coffee_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
